    "WY_only_delta_zh": "chunk_gated_delta_rule.py +57/-1，加23行加载器；也可沿用既有worker只替换_compute_kernel_inputs_from_torch_wy，保留配套H/O。",
    "gating_exclusion_zh": "不应用fused_gdn_gating.py新增包装及gdn_310.py的gating入口替换；保留现有fused_gdn_gating_pytorch和dtype路径。",
    "unrelated_baseline_differences_zh": "head的gdn_310.py相对镜像另带masked_fill_/index_copy_状态写回差异，WY候选不应整文件带入。",
