    "torch_dispatch_namespace": "cann_ops_transformer",
    "namespace_limit_zh": "定向wheel可分Python包名，但Torch schema namespace和builder的cann_ops_transformer.utils.arg_check导入仍硬编码；严格私有namespace需薄绑定适配。",
    "upstream_fallback_zh": "#18057加载失败或shape不支持会回退Torch；正式数值门禁需显式绑定并断言来源/shape、禁用静默回退。",
    "WY_contract_zh": "chunk64，T对齐64，q/k/v/beta FP16，g FP32且非正；K/V为16倍数且≤128，Hv%Hk=0，B≤32，Hv≤64；与此前TP2观测的Hk8/Hv16/KV128静态兼容，未做设备验证。"
  },
